        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The outside activity would not place the employee in a situation where there is a conflict, or in a situation which gives the reasonable basis for the impression of a conflict, between his or her private interests and his or her official duties and responsibilities (see section 5, above, \"Conflict of Interest\", for additional guidance).",
            "block_bbox": [
                282,
                195,
                1068,
                339
